==Battleground==
*1 [[Kyuubei]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**5 [[Kyuubei]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**15 [[Kyuubei]]s spawn, delay 5.33~6.67 seconds<sup>160f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

